; Ground truth: SAT and coherent (adult member fee 10, child member fee 2).
(def-concept Person)
(def-concept Adult Person)
(def-concept Child Person)
(def-concept Member Person)
(def-property fee Member Integer)
(forall ((x Adult)) (implies (Member x) (gt fee 5)))
(forall ((x Child)) (implies (Member x) (lt fee 6)))
(exists (x) (and (Member x) (Adult x) (eq fee 10)))
(exists (x) (and (Member x) (Child x) (eq fee 2)))
